    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῠχ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accidental,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.78C.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				<i>casually,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.9.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.222
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τυχαῖον, τό,</span>
			<i>temple of Fortuna</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τύχη</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				43.21
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				1.800
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thrace</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				585.5
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyprus</span>); at Constantinople, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.Mil.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4.15
			</span></i>: late spelling <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τυχέῳ</span>
			(dat.) <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				9i 21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπορος τυχαίων</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.419
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Messana</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τυχαία, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τύχη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				4556
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>).</div>
